=== REASONING ===
Widget merges two data sources (audit logs + security events) into a single EventFeedItem[] feed.
Standard (2×4): WidgetEventFeed with maxItems=15, sorted by timestamp (handled by shared component).
Compact (1×2): WidgetBigNumber showing 24h event count + worst-severity badge.
Security events get severity from locked/sentryMode fields; audit entries infer from action keyword.
useSecurityEvents requires vehicleId string — follow CommandHistoryWidget pattern (props → first vehicle fallback).
Both hooks pass freshness props to WidgetShell; combined isLoading/isFetching/isStale/isError.

